sc": "8月19日，台风白海豚的残余低压已经转化为温带气旋，彻底离开了我国东北，黑龙江、吉林的散装暴雨已经结束。但与此同时，我国东部海区、太平洋深处以及中太平洋共有四个风暴活动。它们分别是我国华南附近的台风胚胎95W，华东附近的台风胚胎94W，太平洋深处的18号台风沙德尔，以及中太平洋飓风拉拉。\n其中，我国近海的这两个台风胚胎环流连在一起，结构非常松散，像一个体型庞大的散黄双黄蛋，且离陆地已经很近了。在陆地和对方的影响下，它们加强成为正规台风的可能性已经越来越小。尤其是华东近海的94W，它中心空洞，几乎看不出气旋", "state": 0, "duration": 209, "mission_id": 4067021, "rights": {"bp": 0, "elec": 0, "download": 0, "movie": 0, "pay": 0, "hd5": 0, "no_reprint": 0, "autoplay": 1, "ugc_pay": 0, "is_cooperation": 0, "ugc_pay_preview": 0, "no_background": 0, "arc_pay": 0, "pay_free_watch": 0}, "owner": {"mid": 547072854, "name": "中气爱", "face": "https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/face/e5f6be30a18988ed92f677e6a47a346270172081.jpg"}, "stat": {"aid": 117122583762590, "view": 341441, "danmaku": 892, "reply": 1710, "favorite": 1188, "coin": 738, "share": 1367, "now_rank": 0, "his_rank": 0, "like": 19470, "dislike": 0, "vt": 0, "vv": 341441, "fav_g": 0, "like_g": 0}, "dynamic": "", "cid": 41071281316, "dimension": {"width": 1920, "height": 1080, "rotate": 0}, "short_link_v2": "https://b23.tv/BV1X48J6nETi", "first_frame": "http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/storyff/_00001daf48tdq2h9428l0fxl5ixfm7b_firsti.jpg", "pub_location": "江苏", "cover43": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ffdf0b50bb3e9d11b2b50aac1f9207cc2c5b1e9d.jpg", "tidv2": 2207, "tnamev2": "随拍·综合", "pid_v2": 1032, "pid_name_v2": "其他", "attribute_v3": 4, "bvid": "BV1X48J6nETi", "season_type": 0, "is_ogv": false, "ogv_info": null, "enable_vt": 0, "ai_rcmd": null, "rcmd_reason": {"content": "", "corner_mark": 0}}, {"aid": 117104615425659, "videos": 1, "tid": 85, "tname": "小剧场", "copyright": 3, "pic": "http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/d2065708b50d19e461b96bc7089152f49b880d76.jpg", "title": "一口气看7小时高质量原创文娱漫剧《我只想亏钱，怎么捧出一个时代》1~26集", "pubdate": 1786874909, "ctime": 1786874909, "desc": "1-26集，持续更新中", "state": 0, "duration": 25188, "mission_id": 4067018, "rights": {"bp": 0, "elec": 0, "download": 0, "movie": 0, "pay": 0, "hd5": 0, "no_reprint": 0, "autoplay": 1, "ugc_pay": 0, "is_cooperation": 0, "ugc_pay_preview": 0, "no_background": 0, "arc_pay": 0, "pay_free_watch": 0}, "owner": {"mid": 40888334, "name": "上台就犯病", "face": "https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/face/e31df1c805680d813680e9c41a8f7c3b3d8a65f6.jpg"}, "stat": {"aid": 117104615425659, "view": 427013, "danmaku": 5381, "reply": 1239, "favorite": 30859, "coin": 14711, "share": 2211, "now_rank": 0, "his_rank": 0, "like": 32391, "dislike": 0, "vt": 0, "vv": 427013, "fav_g": 0, "like_g": 0}, "dynamic": "", "cid": 40960000919, "dimension": {"width": 1920, "height": 1080, "rotate": 0}, "short_link_v2": "https://b23.tv/BV17tb96RENv", "first_frame": "http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/storyff/_00002y3t53x9a3dbo1zn9st3t94kxkb_firsti.jpg", "pub_location": "安徽", "cover43": "http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/2f021bbca269850a0421f3c55fa943c811fb45e7.jpg", "tidv2": 2037, "tnamev2": "同人动画", "pid_v2": 1005, "pid_name_v2": "二次元", "attribute_v3": 4, "bvid": "BV17tb96RENv", "season_type": 0, "is_ogv": false, "ogv_info": null, "enable_vt": 0, "ai_rcmd": null, "rcmd_reason": {"content": "", "corner_mark": 0}}, {"aid": 117121845561121, "videos": 1, "tid": 193, "tname": "MV", "copyright": 1, "pic": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/04e19d866f804a959a5de7ff61edf6a1752eb5fb.jpg", "title": "【七夕】我用50部电影来感受《出现又离开》这首歌，发现早已热泪盈眶", "pubdate": 1787137693, "ctime": 1787137693, "desc": "今天这期视频的主题是：“出现”和“离开”\n最近有不少人问我说，馆长，你七夕准备发什么歌曲？\n其实我在8月份开始的时候，就已经想好了要发哪首歌曲\n所以在这半个月的时间里，我翻看了大量的电影\n我的脑海中一直萦绕着《出现又离开》里面的场景\n直到电影拼图一块一块的拼凑起来，终于做出了这个视频\n我们的一生，似乎一直都在经历着“出现”和“离开”\n我们总是在不断的“重逢”，也在不断的“道别”\n梁博这首《出现又离开》正是道出了这种人生的苦涩\n我用50多部电影来感受《出现又离开》这首歌\n突然发现，自己早已热泪盈眶\n愿有情人", "state": 0, "duration": 404, "mission_id": 4067473, "rights": {"bp": 0, "elec": 0, "download": 0, "movie": 0, "pay": 0, "hd5": 0, "no_reprint": 1, "autoplay": 1, "ugc_pay": 0, "is_cooperation": 0, "ugc_pay_preview": 0, "no_background": 0, "arc_pay": 0, "pay_free_watch": 0}, "owner": {"mid": 229733301, "name": "音乐私藏馆", "face": "https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/face/91a6526445f61e2d491523242b532d5e76f0435a.jpg"}, "stat": {"aid": 1171